hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18484","Yahya narrated to us, from Shubah, Ziyad ibn Ilaqah narrated to me, from Arfajah who said: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: There will be troubles and troubles, so whoever wants to divide the affair of the Muslims while they are united, strike him with the sword whoever he is."
"18485","Hashim ibn al-Qasim narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Ziyad ibn Ilaqah, from Arfajah al-Ashjai that he heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say, he said: And Shayban ibn Shurayh al-Aslami said, and he mentioned the hadith."
